{"results": [{"id": "hp_doc_699d495edd7219874efb6861a6b8fa48b1fe666471b7780ea239b707a85ef8dc", "title": "Milena Govich", "text": "Milena Govich (born October 29, 1976) is an American actress, singer, dancer, and musician, best known for portraying NYPD Detective Nina Cassady on the television series \"Law & Order\".", "score": 24.6345}, {"id": "hp_doc_aaa0360ddba9e6fa2d7d3539669c9bfb0904c156c81bb4cb439388a256156c5f", "title": "Jenny Wade", "text": "Jennifer \"Jenny\" Wade (born October 6, 1980) is an American actress known for playing Liz Traynor on the Fox television series \"The Good Guys\", Nina in The CW television series \"Reaper\", and the character of Honey Pie in the \"Feast\" film trilogy.", "score": 12.4835}, {"id": "hp_doc_ca99ac2a67c286eb6e008349e101e73b98237b1a8584edca3618e4fd020184c2", "title": "Jada Facer", "text": "Facer's first major role was in the TV movie \"Love's Christmas Journey\" in 2011, in which she played the role of Annabelle. For this role, she won the Young Artist Award for Best Leading Young Actress in a TV Movie, Miniseries or Special. She was also nominated for the Young Artist Award for Best Young Actress Ten and Under in a Short Film for her performance in the 2012 short film \"Nina Del Tango\". She has guest starred on a number of TV shows including Nickelodeon's \"Henry Danger\".", "score": 10.9687}], "remaining_searches": 2}
